  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Details : </strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/rrb-paramedical-staff-cen-no-03-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</a></span> has released the CBT-I Result/Cutoff for the post of Paramedical Staff Posts on the official website of RRB. This recruitment was released for 434 posts. Applications for the Railway RRB Paramedical Staff Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 09 August 2025, to 18 September 2025. The CBT examination was conducted on 10 to 12 March 2026. Candidates who have appeared in this Examination can check their RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026 from the link provided below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Railway RRB Paramedical CEN 03/2025 Post Result 2026 </span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB Paramedical Staff Advt. No. CEN 03/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>09 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>18 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>18 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Status : <strong>09 December 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Revised Exam Date : <strong>11, 12 &amp; 13 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>02 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>08 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>21 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result/Cutoff : <strong>29 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH <b>: Rs. 250/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female&nbsp;<b>: Rs. 250/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>After Appear the Stage I Exam</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UR, OBC, EWS Fee Refund : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC,&nbsp; ST, PH, Female Refund <b>: Rs. 250/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Paramedical Staff Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">As on 01 January 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <b>18-21 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <b>33-43 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RRB Paramedical Staff Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Paramedical Staff 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 434 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Nursing Superintendent</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">272</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Radiographer (X-Ray Technician)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lab Assistant Grade-II</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">12</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ECG Technician</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pharmacist (Entry Grade)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">105</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Health &amp; Malaria Inspector Grade-II</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">33</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Dialysis Technician</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Railway RRB Paramedical Staff Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Medical Degree / Diploma / Certificate in Related Trade / Branch from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Railway RRB Paramedical Staff Online Form 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT 1</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT 2</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the&nbsp;<strong>Download Result/Cutoff</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the Result/Cutoff.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the Railway RRB Paramedical Result/Cutoff from the official website of RRB also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 100.27%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Check Zone Wise RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Region Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Exam Result</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Allahabad</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"blob:https://rrbpryj.gov.in/89b137bc-153b-474a-98b0-0c4c786f1717\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Result</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"blob:https://rrbpryj.gov.in/89b137bc-153b-474a-98b0-0c4c786f1717\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Patna</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.rrbpatna.gov.in/pdf/Result_cutoff_Para_03_2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Result</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.rrbpatna.gov.in/pdf/Result_cutoff_Para_03_2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Ahmedabad</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Result</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Gorakhpur</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Result</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Kolkata</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.rrbkolkata.gov.in/file/22-KOLKATA-RRB_Paramedical_shortlisting%20for%20DV_Roll_29.05.2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Result</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.rrbkolkata.gov.in/file/22-KOLKATA-RRB_Paramedical_shortlisting%20for%20DV_cut%20off_29.05.2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Ajmer</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Result</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Mumbai</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Result</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>RRB Ranchi</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://rrbra