llow\">Hindi</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.rrbapply.gov.in/#/auth/landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Date Extend Notice</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://rrbahmedabad.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Corrigendum-1_Paramedical_03_2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://rrbald.gov.in/Final%20CEN%2003%202025%20%20English.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sarkari Exam Mobile App</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Join WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresulinfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Has the RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026 been released?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes the RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026 has been released.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When was the RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026 officially announced?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026 has issued on <strong>29 May 2026</strong>&nbsp;by RRB.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When will the RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 2026 exam be held?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> The RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I examination was conducted on<strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"226\"> 11, 12 &amp; 13 March</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Where can I check the RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official RRB website:&nbsp;<strong>indianrailways.gov.in</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What should I search on the website to find the RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 CBT-I Result/Cutoff 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;Look for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"797\">“Result/Cutoff – RRB Paramedical Staff CEN.No.03/2025 Recruitment 2025”</strong>&nbsp;in the notifications list</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What login credentials do I need to download the CBT-I Result/Cutoff?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Typically you will need your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1068\">Registration Number</strong>&nbsp;(or Roll Number)&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1093\">and</strong>&nbsp;your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1116\">Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;(or Password) to login.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is RRB RPF Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of RRB RPF is https://indianrailways.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
